{"id":"a8e2f1731b950254","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Module","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Module","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,N,Q,m,m&#39;,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,N,Q,m,m&#39;,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(m,m&#39;,N,M,+_M)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land m&#39;\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in N\\;\\bigl(+_M(\\langle m&#39;,n\\rangle)=m\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(m,m&#39;,N,M,+_M)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land m&#39;\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in N\\;\\bigl(+_M(\\langle m&#39;,n\\rangle)=m\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S(Q,M,N,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land Q=\\{[m]_{\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(-,-,N,M,+_M)}:m\\in M\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S(Q,M,N,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land Q=\\{[m]_{\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(-,-,N,M,+_M)}:m\\in M\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient carrier consists of equivalence classes, not a notation-only collection of cosets whose ambient module structure is left implicit.</li>\n<li>陪集关系与子模谓词现在共享同一个显式加法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_M\">\\(+_M\\)</span>；不存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_R\\)</span> 和未绑定减法均已移除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,N,Q,m,m',+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(m,m',N,M,+_M)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land m'\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in N\\;\\bigl(+_M(\\langle m',n\\rangle)=m\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientModule}_S(Q,M,N,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land Q=\\{[m]_{\\mathrm{CosetEq}_S(-,-,N,M,+_M)}:m\\in M\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"+_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_R","display":false}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-module]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ef3a5dd6825f0373","4deff85a84639467"]}